<html><head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><img alt="QantasLetterheadUpdated" src="" style="max-width: 714.7100952148437px" title="QantasLetterheadUpdated" /><br />
<br />
Hello {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},<br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">&lt;Unsuccessful call&gt;</span></span></i></b></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i>&nbsp;</i></b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">I hope this message finds you well.</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">I'm sorry that we were unable to speak today, I wanted to personally congratulate you on attaining Platinum One.</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">&lt;Successful call&gt; </span></span></i></b></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Thanks again for speaking with me today, it was a pleasure to be able to congratulate you on attaining Platinum One.</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Your Platinum One status will enhance your existing Chairmans Lounge membership - you’ll continue to enjoy all the privileges you’ve become accustomed to, along with many more:</span></span></span></span></span>
<ul>
	<li style="margin-left:8px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">The highest upgrade priority and access to Reward seats</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="margin-left:8px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">The opportunity to share your benefits with loved ones</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="margin-left:8px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Complimentary Platinum status for a family member or friend</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="margin-left:8px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Extra Qantas Points bonuses up to 175,000 per Membership Year</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:8px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">No booking fees on new eligible Qantas bookings</span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">A full list of inclusions and benefits can be found at </span></span><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/status-and-clubs/status/platinum-one.html" style="color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Platinum One.</span></a></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:11.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Thank you for your continued loyalty and once again, welcome to Platinum One!</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
Kind Regards,<br />
&nbsp;<br />
{{{Sender.FirstName}}}<br />
Qantas VIP Service Team&nbsp;<br />
Within Australia 1300 752 801<br />
World Wide &nbsp;+61 2 6122 1111
</body></html>